<title>CHINA: China Jan-Feb copper raw material imports up.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Feb copper raw material imports up.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>China imported 14,887 tonnes of unrefined copper and copper anodes for electrolytic refining in the first two months, up 67.4 percent year-on-year, customs figures showed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Imports in February alone were 8,429 tonnes, the figures showed.</p>
<p>China's imports of copper waste and scrap reached 75,868 tonnes in the first two months, up 10.8 percent compared with the year-ago period, it said.</p>
<p>Imports in February alone were 37,528 tonnes, it said.</p>
</text>
